  m_Name: SSO_Log_Torch
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  Header: Security Memorandum
  Body: 'Your crystal torches are equipped with a height detector.


    DO NOT jump
    if the crystal is red.


    DO NOT rappel down if the crystal light has faded
    out.


    Injuries resulting from misuse of said equipment won''t be covered
    by company insurance.'
